# Trial-Size Trial by Earth (bastok 72): a WAR of level 20 at fame level 2 is not offered (254); accepted by GM, the
# WAR's trade of the fork returns nil (the SMN test of the trade), and the talk is 251.
lists PortBastok/Ferrol/onTrigger PortBastok/Ferrol/onTrade
char zone=PortBastok pos=33.7,6.5,-39.4 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Bastok 50
item MiniTuningForkOfEarth
login
trigger Ferrol                 # not a SMN: not offered, 254
finish
quest Bastok.TrialSizeTrialByEarth accepted
trade Ferrol MiniTuningForkOfEarth x1  # not a SMN: nil, nothing
trigger Ferrol                 # the fork held: 251
finish
